<title>USA: United Security secures settlement.</title>
<headline>United Security secures settlement.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Security Bancorp said Tuesday it has received an insurance payment of about $637,000 as reimbursement for losses from a previously-disclosed embezzlement.</p>
<p>The settlement, equal to about $420,000, or $0.11 a share, after tax, will be credited to USBN's third quarter earnings.</p>
<p>The payment covers the principal stolen, less a $50,000 deductible. The FBI is continuing to investigate the crime.</p>
<p>The embezzlement resulted in an after-tax adjustment to USBN's 1996 earnings of about $530,000, reducing net income from $3.7 million to $3.2 million, or $0.86 a share.</p>
</text>
